---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import InquiryForm from "../components/InquiryForm.astro";
import { customConsultationHref } from "../../shared/custom-automation";
import "../styles/custom-automation.css";
---
<Base title="Discuss a Business Solution | Cyber Pirate Labs" description="Request a core solution demonstration or discuss a custom automation. Share your business problem, useful outcome and workflow to explore an appropriate software scope.">
 <section class="demo-request"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Let's start with your business</p><h1>See what a useful<br /><span>solution can do.</span></h1><p class="hero-summary">Tell us a little about your business and the problem you want help handling. We will explore a core solution or a custom automation, its useful outcome and an appropriate scope.</p><div class="demo-expectations"><span>01</span><p>The recurring problem, your current process and the information your team needs.</p><span>02</span><p>A useful core solution example or the outcome a custom workflow should deliver.</p><span>03</span><p>The connections, boundaries and management your setup needs.</p></div><p class="contact-note">A request starts a conversation. A meeting time, pricing, usage and delivery scope are agreed separately.</p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:astarrett@cyberpiratelabs.com">Prefer email? Contact CPL &nearr;</a><a class="text-link" href="/#experience">Explore the illustrative experience first &darr;</a><p class="custom-form-note">Have a workflow beyond the ten core services? <a class="text-link" href="/custom-automation/">Explore custom automation</a> or <a class="text-link" href={customConsultationHref}>request a consultation</a>.</p></div><InquiryForm sourcePath="/demo/" /></div></section>
</Base>
